      "license": "MIT (code) / CC-BY-4.0 (documentation)",
      "abstract": "Implements the three-condition experiment from the Conservation Law: Baseline (paraphrase loop, no enforcement), Compression (summarize loop, no extraction), and Gate (compress → extract commitment kernel → reconstruct → feed back). Runs real NLI inference against real model outputs.",
